{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">《2026 香港小姐競選決賽》於今晚（30 日）8 時於 TVB 翡翠台現場直播。在率先登場的紅地氈環節中，今年出道的「魔音女團」MYNT 6 位成員——隊長宋宛穎（Sabrina）、倪嘉雯（Carmen）、莊子璇（Hilary）、倪樂琳（Ellyn）、喬美莎（Chelsea）及盧映彤（Skylar），齊齊以華麗晚裝驚艷亮相。</span><br/><br/></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"0532b12a-6958-4cf2-a295-e277241546ea.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026FzxehADuoO1788090221.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0532b12a-6958-4cf2-a295-e277241546ea.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">6 位「魔女」今次一致以白色 Tone 造型登場，各有各亮點、各展美態！當中 3 位港姐冠軍莊子璇、倪樂琳與宋宛穎，齊齊以低胸裝盛裝上陣，展現超強女神氣場。倪嘉雯則身穿高衩晚裝大晒修長美腿，喬美莎以璀璨耀眼的 Bling Bling 裙亮眼示人，而盧映彤今次更激罕嘗試「輕性感」風格，令人眼前一亮！</span><br/><br/></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f527111f-c51a-4ca7-a880-32404ebdfb16.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026oDv40gm7D51788090222.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f527111f-c51a-4ca7-a880-32404ebdfb16.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e22484ff-e726-473b-8af9-ceed5aadc266.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026KNaqqRRWWj1788090221.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e22484ff-e726-473b-8af9-ceed5aadc266.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2542267b-13f6-4bd0-8c72-64ca9d39411b.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026sYBkliB4gf1788090220.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2542267b-13f6-4bd0-8c72-64ca9d39411b.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"88ed458e-95c0-4925-8e18-f5f65045c8b4.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026Lzfdh0Z8641788090220.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"88ed458e-95c0-4925-8e18-f5f65045c8b4.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T12:03:25.236237+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":314,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}